{"ticker":"BXP","updated":"2026-10-30T22:38:03Z","profile":{"longName":"BXP, Inc.","shortName":"BXP, Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Office","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bxp.com","fullTimeEmployees":826,"marketCap":11359101952,"trailingPE":18.802395,"forwardPE":30.109072,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.326486,"pegRatio":2.34,"targetMeanPrice":73.4,"targetHighPrice":95.0,"targetLowPrice":54.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.055,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.59239,"operatingMargins":0.32681,"profitMargins":0.15607001,"totalRevenue":3414745088,"beta":1.054,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":74.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":49.72,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.44},"summary":"BXP, Inc. is the largest publicly traded developer, owner, and manager of premier workplaces in the United States. It is concentrated in six dynamic gateway markets - Boston, Los Angeles, New York, San Francisco, Seattle, and Washington, DC. BXP has delivered places that power progress for our clients and communities for more than 55 years. BXP is a fully integrated real estate company, organized as a real estate investment trust (REIT). As of June 30, 2026, including properties owned by joint ventures, BXP's portfolio totals 51.1 million square feet and 164 properties, including six properties under construction/redevelopment. BXP's portfolio consists of 143 office properties, 13 retail properties, seven residential properties (including four residential properties under construction) and one hotel. BXP is well known for its in-house building management expertise and responsiveness to clients' needs. BXP holds a superior track record of developing premium Central Business District (CBD) office buildings, successful mixed-use complexes, suburban office centers and build-to-suit projects for a diverse array of creditworthy clients. BXP actively works to promote its growth and operations in a sustainable and responsible manner. BXP, Inc. was incorporated in 1970 in Delaware and is based in Massachusetts, Boston.","summary_zh":"BXP, Inc. 是美國最大的上市開發商、一流工作場所的所有者和管理者。它集中在六個充滿活力的門戶市場——波士頓、洛杉磯、紐約、舊金山、西雅圖和華盛頓特區。 55 年來，BXP 一直致力於為我們的客戶和社區提供推動進步的場所。 BXP 是一家完全一體化的房地產公司，以房地產投資信託基金 (REIT) 的形式組成。截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日，包括合資企業擁有的房產在內，BXP 的投資組合總面積為 5,110 萬平方英尺，擁有 164 處房產，其中包括 6 處正在建造/重建的房產。 BXP 的投資組合包括 143 個辦公物業、13 個零售物業、7 個住宅物業（包括 4 個在建住宅物業）和 1 個飯店。 BXP 以其內部建築管理專業知識和對客戶需求的回應能力而聞名。 BXP 在為各類信譽良好的客戶開發優質中央商務區 (CBD) 辦公大樓、成功的綜合用途綜合體、郊區辦公中心和客製化專案方面擁有卓越的記錄。 BXP 積極致力於以永續和負責任的方式促進其成長和營運。 BXP, Inc. 於 1970 年在德拉瓦州註冊成立，總部位於麻薩諸塞州波士頓。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 辦公室","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":71.52,"h":72.61,"l":71.18,"c":72.4,"v":1486000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":72.17,"h":73.9,"l":72.08,"c":73.78,"v":1364000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":74.21,"h":75.61,"l":73.89,"c":75.29,"v":2322200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":76.04,"h":77.42,"l":75.68,"c":76.83,"v":2049900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":75.0,"h":76.11,"l":73.32,"c":75.79,"v":3498700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":75.0,"h":75.0,"l":72.01,"c":72.4,"v":3222900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":71.19,"h":74.33,"l":71.19,"c":73.87,"v":2389100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":73.96,"h":76.6,"l":73.64,"c":76.23,"v":1508300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":76.27,"h":77.92,"l":76.05,"c":77.18,"v":2141900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":77.69,"h":77.94,"l":76.28,"c":77.81,"v":2099900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":77.95,"h":79.22,"l":77.66,"c":78.93,"v":2682900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":78.94,"h":79.33,"l":76.34,"c":76.43,"v":1667700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":76.46,"h":78.18,"l":76.24,"c":77.75,"v":1480000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":78.03,"h":78.23,"l":76.11,"c":76.44,"v":6244800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":75.63,"h":76.39,"l":75.03,"c":75.64,"v":1453900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":76.05,"h":77.27,"l":75.87,"c":76.19,"v":1105000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":75.25,"h":76.24,"l":74.85,"c":75.46,"v":2856200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":74.8,"h":75.49,"l":73.74,"c":75.36,"v":5472200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":75.36,"h":75.54,"l":74.01,"c":74.